{
    "id": "agenda-overview@beatlink",
    "name": "Agenda Overview",
    "description": "A right-pane widget whose search/filter/sort/prefix/color rules re-file the active profile's matching notes under a shared overview note shown as a built-in collection view, and write the same task list out as an iCal feed note it ships (#customResourceProvider agendaCalendar.ical). Its own settings note (schema.json/defaults.json/config.json, tagged #agendaOverviewConfig) holds the profiles, the date rules and the date/recurrence display elements, plus the Agenda Settings page that edits all of it. Nothing about area, priority or template is stored there: for each of area-picker@beatlink, priority-widget@beatlink and template-picker@beatlink that is installed, this addon generates a prefix, colour, grouping, sort, search group and filter group live from that addon's own settings note (#areaConfig / #priorityConfig / #templatePickerConfig), keyed picker-<name>, with every value ticked and only your on/off flags remembered - so renaming an area or adding a template shows up immediately and nothing can drift. Uninstall a picker and its entries leave with it; with none installed there are no searches, so the overview is empty until you add one. Your own entries can be sourced the same way (Type / Source / Sort By). Template classifies by a note's ~template relation rather than a label, so run template-picker's Scan once; a generated template search also skips notes filed directly under another note of the same template, so a subtask does not show up beside its parent. Self-contained otherwise - it ships no sibling's code. Every sibling owns its own settings note and reads nothing from this one - agenda-task@beatlink (the Task pane; #agendaTaskConfig), agenda-myday@beatlink (the My Day focus panel; #agendaMyDayConfig) and agenda-organize@beatlink (the GTD triage page; #agendaOrganizeConfig), which keeps its own separate dimensions registry for its triage queues.",
    "author": "BeatLink",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Trilium-Community/trilium-scripts/tree/main/addons/agenda-overview@beatlink",
    "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later",
    "latestVersion": "5.3.0",
